# Synthesizer Labship, station 2+: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, up to one other target artifact you control becomes an artifact creature with base power and toughness 2/2 and gains flying until end of turn." One charge counter is not enough; Dauntless Scrapbot's station gives 3, so at the beginning of combat on turn 3 the Lander token (an artifact with only the subtype Lander, which it keeps) becomes a 2/2 flying artifact creature, which attacks, and is a plain artifact again next turn. The Labship itself is no creature below 9 (CR 721.2a-b, 613.1).

